{"seq":1,"slug":"bayesian-theorem-interpretations","title":"贝叶斯定理三种解读","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/bayesian-statistics/foundations/bayesian-theorem-interpretations","wordCount":1153,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"贝叶斯定理三种解读\">贝叶斯定理三种解读</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>贝叶斯定理本身只是条件概率的代数变形，但不同哲学立场赋予它截然不同的含义：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>D</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(\\theta|D) = \\frac{P(D|\\theta)\\,P(\\theta)}{P(D)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>三个关键量：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(\\theta)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>：<strong>先验（prior）</strong>——观测数据前对参数的信念</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>D</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(D|\\theta)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>：<strong>似然（likelihood）</strong>——给定参数时数据出现的概率</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(\\theta|D)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>：<strong>后验（posterior）</strong>——观测数据后更新的信念</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(D)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>：<strong>边际似然（evidence）</strong>——数据在所有参数下的平均可能性</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    Prior[&quot;先验 P(θ)&quot;] --&gt; Bayes[&quot;贝叶斯更新&quot;]&#10;    Likelihood[&quot;似然 P(D|θ)&quot;] --&gt; Bayes&#10;    Bayes --&gt; Posterior[&quot;后验 P(θ|D)&quot;]&#10;    Posterior --&gt;|&quot;下一次观测&quot;| NewPrior[&quot;新先验&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    Prior[\"先验 P(θ)\"] --&gt; Bayes[\"贝叶斯更新\"]\n    Likelihood[\"似然 P(D|θ)\"] --&gt; Bayes\n    Bayes --&gt; Posterior[\"后验 P(θ|D)\"]\n    Posterior --&gt;|\"下一次观测\"| NewPrior[\"新先验\"]</pre><p>三种解读框架：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>解读视角</th>\n<th>核心隐喻</th>\n<th>代表人物</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>信念更新</td>\n<td>理性 agent 的主观概率修正</td>\n<td>de Finetti、Savage</td>\n<td>决策理论、序贯学习</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>逆概率</td>\n<td>从结果推原因（逆向推断）</td>\n<td>Bayes、Laplace</td>\n<td>参数估计、病因推断</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生成模型</td>\n<td>显式建模数据生成过程</td>\n<td>Jaynes</td>\n<td>概率编程、因果推断</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"信念更新视角\">信念更新视角</h2><p><strong>de Finetti 的主观主义</strong>：概率是 agent 对命题成立的置信度（degree of belief），没有客观真值。关键结果是 <strong>de Finetti 可交换定理</strong>：无限可交换序列等价于存在某个参数的先验，使得观测条件独立——这从纯主观角度为参数建模提供了基础。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# 掷硬币：从先验 Beta(1,1) 出发，每次观测更新&#10;import numpy as np&#10;from scipy import stats&#10;&#10;alpha, beta = 1, 1  # 均匀先验&#10;for flip in [1, 0, 1, 1, 1]:   # 观测序列：正面=1&#10;    alpha += flip&#10;    beta  += (1 - flip)&#10;    print(f&quot;后验 Beta({alpha},{beta}), 均值={alpha/(alpha+beta):.3f}&quot;)&#10;# Beta(6,2), 均值=0.750 — 5次中4次正面\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 掷硬币：从先验 Beta(1,1) 出发，每次观测更新</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> numpy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> scipy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stats</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">alpha, beta </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # 均匀先验</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> flip </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]:   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 观测序列：正面=1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    alpha </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> flip</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    beta  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> flip)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"后验 Beta(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">alpha</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">beta</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">), 均值=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">alpha</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(alpha</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">beta)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:.3f</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Beta(6,2), 均值=0.750 — 5次中4次正面</span></span></code></pre></div><p>信念更新的操作含义：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>从「什么都不知道」（宽泛先验）到「越来越确定」（后验收窄）</li>\n<li>今天的后验是明天的先验——<strong>序贯更新一致性</strong></li>\n<li>数据量足够时，贝叶斯结果与频率学派收敛（Bernstein-von Mises 定理）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"逆概率视角\">逆概率视角</h2><p>Bayes 原始动机（1763 年论文）是解决<strong>逆概率问题</strong>：已知事件 B 发生，反推原因 A 的概率。这是正向推导的逆过程：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><munder><munder><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>逆：原因的概率</mtext></munder><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><munder><munder><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>正：A成立时B发生</mtext></munder><mo>⋅</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\underbrace{P(A|B)}_{\\text{逆：原因的概率}} = \\frac{\\underbrace{P(B|A)}_{\\text{正：A成立时B发生}} \\cdot P(A)}{P(B)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3263em;vertical-align:-1.5763em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.4237em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">逆：原因的概率</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.102em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"stretchy\" style=\"height:0.548em;min-width:1.6em;\"><span class=\"brace-left\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 6l6-6h17c12.688 0 19.313.3 20 1 4 4 7.313 8.3 10 13\n 35.313 51.3 80.813 93.8 136.5 127.5 55.688 33.7 117.188 55.8 184.5 66.5.688\n 0 2 .3 4 1 18.688 2.7 76 4.3 172 5h399450v120H429l-6-1c-124.688-8-235-61.7\n-331-161C60.687 138.7 32.312 99.3 7 54L0 41V6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-center\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMin slice\"><path d=\"M199572 214\nc100.7 8.3 195.3 44 280 108 55.3 42 101.7 93 139 153l9 14c2.7-4 5.7-8.7 9-14\n 53.3-86.7 123.7-153 211-199 66.7-36 137.3-56.3 212-62h199568v120H200432c-178.3\n 11.7-311.7 78.3-403 201-6 8-9.7 12-11 12-.7.7-6.7 1-18 1s-17.3-.3-18-1c-1.3 0\n-5-4-11-12-44.7-59.3-101.3-106.3-170-141s-145.3-54.3-229-60H0V214z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-right\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M399994 0l6 6v35l-6 11c-56 104-135.3 181.3-238 232-57.3\n 28.7-117 45-179 50H-300V214h399897c43.3-7 81-15 113-26 100.7-33 179.7-91 237\n-174 2.7-5 6-9 10-13 .7-1 7.3-1 20-1h17z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.898em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5763em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.6523em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.7163em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.9663em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.4237em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">正：</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">A</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">成立时</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">B</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">发生</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.102em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"stretchy\" style=\"height:0.548em;min-width:1.6em;\"><span class=\"brace-left\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 6l6-6h17c12.688 0 19.313.3 20 1 4 4 7.313 8.3 10 13\n 35.313 51.3 80.813 93.8 136.5 127.5 55.688 33.7 117.188 55.8 184.5 66.5.688\n 0 2 .3 4 1 18.688 2.7 76 4.3 172 5h399450v120H429l-6-1c-124.688-8-235-61.7\n-331-161C60.687 138.7 32.312 99.3 7 54L0 41V6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-center\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMin slice\"><path d=\"M199572 214\nc100.7 8.3 195.3 44 280 108 55.3 42 101.7 93 139 153l9 14c2.7-4 5.7-8.7 9-14\n 53.3-86.7 123.7-153 211-199 66.7-36 137.3-56.3 212-62h199568v120H200432c-178.3\n 11.7-311.7 78.3-403 201-6 8-9.7 12-11 12-.7.7-6.7 1-18 1s-17.3-.3-18-1c-1.3 0\n-5-4-11-12-44.7-59.3-101.3-106.3-170-141s-145.3-54.3-229-60H0V214z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-right\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M399994 0l6 6v35l-6 11c-56 104-135.3 181.3-238 232-57.3\n 28.7-117 45-179 50H-300V214h399897c43.3-7 81-15 113-26 100.7-33 179.7-91 237\n-174 2.7-5 6-9 10-13 .7-1 7.3-1 20-1h17z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.898em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5763em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>医学诊断经典例子</strong>：乳腺癌筛查</p>\n<ul>\n<li>患病率（先验）：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>cancer</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0.01</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(\\text{cancer}) = 0.01</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cancer</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.01</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li>检测敏感性：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mtext>cancer</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0.9</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(+|\\text{cancer}) = 0.9</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">+</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cancer</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.9</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li>假阳性率：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mtext>no cancer</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0.09</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(+|\\text{no cancer}) = 0.09</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">+</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">no cancer</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.09</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li>阳性预测值（后验）：</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>cancer</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0.9</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>0.01</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>0.9</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>0.01</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0.09</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>0.99</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.092</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(\\text{cancer}|+) = \\frac{0.9 \\times 0.01}{0.9 \\times 0.01 + 0.09 \\times 0.99} \\approx 0.092</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cancer</span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\">+</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0908em;vertical-align:-0.7693em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0.9</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.01</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.09</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.99</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0.9</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.01</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.092</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>结论：检测阳性者实际患癌概率仅 ~9%，低先验率导致大量假阳性——这是纯逆概率推理的典型示范。</p>\n<p>逆概率视角的重要推论：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>基率谬误</strong>（base rate neglect）是人类认知偏差的根源之一</li>\n<li><strong>似然比</strong>（likelihood ratio）是证据强度的核心度量：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>D</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>θ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>D</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>θ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">LR = P(D|\\theta_1)/P(D|\\theta_0)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li>频率学派「条件在数据上做推断」，贝叶斯派「条件在观测上推未知参数」</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"生成模型视角\">生成模型视角</h2><p>Jaynes 在《Probability Theory: The Logic of Science》中将贝叶斯统计重新表述为<strong>扩展逻辑学</strong>：概率代表合理置信度，贝叶斯推断是理性推理的唯一自洽方式（Cox 定理）。</p>\n<p><strong>生成模型</strong>显式指定数据的产生过程：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# 生成模型视角：数据是从某个参数化过程中&quot;生成&quot;的&#10;import pymc as pm&#10;&#10;with pm.Model() as coin_model:&#10;    # 先验：硬币偏差&#10;    theta = pm.Beta(&quot;theta&quot;, alpha=1, beta=1)&#10;    # 似然：n 次独立投掷&#10;    y = pm.Binomial(&quot;y&quot;, n=10, p=theta, observed=7)&#10;    # 后验推断&#10;    trace = pm.sample(1000, return_inferencedata=True)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 生成模型视角：数据是从某个参数化过程中\"生成\"的</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pymc </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pm</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pm.Model() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> coin_model:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 先验：硬币偏差</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    theta </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pm.Beta(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"theta\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">alpha</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">beta</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 似然：n 次独立投掷</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    y </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pm.Binomial(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"y\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">n</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">p</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">theta, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">observed</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">7</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 后验推断</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    trace </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pm.sample(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">return_inferencedata</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>生成模型的三层结构：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    HP[&quot;超参数 (hyperpriors)&quot;] --&gt; Prior[&quot;先验 P(θ)&quot;]&#10;    Prior --&gt; Likelihood[&quot;似然 P(D|θ)&quot;]&#10;    Likelihood --&gt; Data[&quot;观测数据 D&quot;]&#10;    Data -.-&gt;|&quot;贝叶斯推断&quot;| Post[&quot;后验 P(θ|D)&quot;]\">graph TD\n    HP[\"超参数 (hyperpriors)\"] --&gt; Prior[\"先验 P(θ)\"]\n    Prior --&gt; Likelihood[\"似然 P(D|θ)\"]\n    Likelihood --&gt; Data[\"观测数据 D\"]\n    Data -.-&gt;|\"贝叶斯推断\"| Post[\"后验 P(θ|D)\"]</pre><p>优势：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>反事实推理</strong>：可以问「如果数据不同，参数会怎样？」</li>\n<li><strong>缺失数据自然处理</strong>：未观测变量作为潜变量积分掉</li>\n<li><strong>预测分布</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>y</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>∫</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>y</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(\\tilde{y}|D) = \\int P(\\tilde{y}|\\theta) P(\\theta|D)\\,d\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.35em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">~</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1111em;vertical-align:-0.3061em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"margin-right:0.1945em;position:relative;top:-0.0006em;\">∫</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.35em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">~</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"频率学派-vs-贝叶斯学派的本质分歧\">频率学派 vs 贝叶斯学派的本质分歧</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>频率学派</th>\n<th>贝叶斯学派</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>概率定义</td>\n<td>长期频率（客观）</td>\n<td>主观置信度（可为主观）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>参数</td>\n<td>固定未知常数</td>\n<td>随机变量，有分布</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>推断对象</td>\n<td>置信区间（95% CI）</td>\n<td>可信区间（credible interval）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>先验信息</td>\n<td>不进入推断</td>\n<td>显式编码为先验</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>小样本</td>\n<td>依赖渐近理论</td>\n<td>先验正则化，小样本也可用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>p 值</td>\n<td>核心工具</td>\n<td>后验概率替代（$P(H_0</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>置信区间 vs 可信区间的认知陷阱</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>频率 95% CI 的正确解读：「如果无数次重复实验，95% 的区间包含真值」（参数固定）</li>\n<li>贝叶斯 95% 可信区间：「给定数据，参数有 95% 的概率落在此区间」（参数随机）</li>\n<li>后者符合人类直觉，但需要先验假设</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>贝叶斯定理的三种解读（信念更新 / 逆概率 / 生成模型）并非竞争性的，而是互补的视角</li>\n<li>de Finetti 可交换定理为主观先验的合理性提供了理论支撑</li>\n<li>Jaynes 的 Cox 定理表明概率演算是一致性推理的唯一选择</li>\n<li>频率与贝叶斯的核心分歧在于「参数是否有先验分布」以及「概率是否可以主观」</li>\n<li>实践中，贝叶斯在小样本 / 需要不确定性量化 / 序贯决策场景优势明显</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"贝叶斯定理三种解读","id":"贝叶斯定理三种解读"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"信念更新视角","id":"信念更新视角"},{"level":2,"text":"逆概率视角","id":"逆概率视角"},{"level":2,"text":"生成模型视角","id":"生成模型视角"},{"level":2,"text":"频率学派 vs 贝叶斯学派的本质分歧","id":"频率学派-vs-贝叶斯学派的本质分歧"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"先验选择策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/bayesian-statistics/foundations/prior-selection-strategies"}}